<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LastTheWord | A Word-Chain Game</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A fast, offline word-chain game where each word begins with the letter the last word ended on.">
    <style>
        :root { --bg: #0a0f14; --panel: #111820; --line: #1e2a36; --text: #e8eef4; --dim: #8fa3b5; --green: #5fd38d; --blue: #6fb4e8; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 32px 20px 72px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 16px/1.65 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
        main { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
        .brand { color: var(--green); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-decoration: none; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 18px; font-size: 0.875rem; }
        a { color: var(--green); }
        .nav-links a { color: var(--dim); text-decoration: none; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--green); }
        .hero { padding: 48px 32px; text-align: center; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; }
        .eyebrow, h2 { color: var(--blue); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h1 { margin: 8px 0 14px; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 8vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
        .tagline { max-width: 580px; margin: auto; color: var(--dim); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .chain { margin: 30px 0 0; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; word-spacing: 6px; }
        .chain span { color: var(--green); }
        .availability { display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px; padding: 9px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(95, 211, 141, .35); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--green); font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; }
        section { margin-top: 24px; padding: 32px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; }
        h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; }
        p { margin: 0; }
        .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 22px; }
        .feature { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; }
        .feature h3 { margin: 0 0 7px; color: var(--green); font-size: 1rem; }
        .feature p { color: var(--dim); font-size: .92rem; }
        .modes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
        .mode { padding: 22px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(111, 180, 232, .05); border: 1px solid rgba(111, 180, 232, .2); }
        .mode h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--blue); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .mode p { color: var(--dim); }
        footer { margin-top: 42px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--dim); font-size: .85rem; text-align: center; }
        footer a { text-decoration: none; }
        @media (max-width: 600px) { body { padding: 20px 12px 48px; } nav { margin-bottom: 32px; } .hero, section { padding: 28px 20px; } .features, .modes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <nav aria-label="LastTheWord navigation">
        <a class="brand" href="/lasttheword/">LASTTHEWORD</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/lasttheword/support/">Support</a>
            <a href="/lasttheword/privacy_policy/">Privacy</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">The word-chain game</p>
        <h1>LASTTHEWORD</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Every word must begin with the letter the last one ended on. That is the whole rule, and it is the last simple thing about it.</p>
        <p class="chain">apple <span>&rarr;</span> elephant <span>&rarr;</span> train <span>&rarr;</span> nest</p>
        <p class="availability">Coming soon to the App Store</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>The pressure builds</h2>
        <p>The clock is running. A longer word scores more. A rarer word scores more still. A streak multiplies everything - and every word you get right shaves a little more time off the next turn, so a good run gets harder precisely because it is going well.</p>
        <div class="features">
            <article class="feature"><h3>Offline by design</h3><p>The complete dictionary is built into the app, so every mode works without an internet connection.</p></article>
            <article class="feature"><h3>Score deeper</h3><p>Build longer, rarer chains and protect your streak to earn the highest scores.</p></article>
            <article class="feature"><h3>Play your way</h3><p>Choose a long-form challenge or a one-minute sprint whenever you have time.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Two ways to play</h2>
        <div class="modes">
            <article class="mode"><h3>Endless</h3><p>Three lives and a per-turn clock that tightens as you go. See how far your streak can carry you.</p></article>
            <article class="mode"><h3>Blitz</h3><p>One 60-second clock for the whole run. Every valid word buys more of it. Fast, tense, and over in a minute.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>LastTheWord by Rıdvan Topal · <a href="/lasttheword/support/">Support</a> · <a href="/lasttheword/privacy_policy/">Privacy Policy</a></footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
